      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose needs to be checked first.\n\n**Sertraline 1000 mg daily is 5 times the maximum recommended adult dose.** Sertraline is usually started at 25\u201350 mg once daily, and the usual maximum is 200 mg/day. A dose of 1000 mg/day is in the overdose range and raises the risk of serotonin syndrome, QT prolongation and seizures.\n\nThis may be a typo for **100 mg** once daily, which is a common dose.\n\nPlease confirm the dose you want:\n- **Sertraline 100 mg by mouth once daily** (or 50 mg, etc.)\n- Or, if 1000 mg is really what you mean, tell me the clinical reason. Even then, a dose this high should be checked with pharmacy before it's entered.\n\nOnce you confirm, I'll enter the order."
      }
